======================================================================
(C) TIGHT-CONFIG SEARCH (exact M): additive invariants of the worry-set
======================================================================
 n= 5 C= 9 thr=1/5, box[1,15]: #tight integer configs=2
     E_+(AP)=8; distinct (E_+, r_+(0)) signatures among tight:
        (E_+=   8, r_+(0)=0) : 1 configs <-- AP energy
        (E_+=   6, r_+(0)=0) : 1 configs
     max E_+ among TIGHT = 8; equals E_+(AP)? True; AP is tight-energy-max? True
        example (E_+=8,r0=0): speeds=(1, 2, 3, 4) -> res mod 9=[1, 2, 3, 4]
        example (E_+=6,r0=0): speeds=(1, 3, 4, 7) -> res mod 9=[1, 3, 4, 7]
